# Never translate line endings. The tree mixes them deliberately - the
# vendored FreeBSD sources under hbsd/ are LF, several tools/ files are CRLF -
# and a checkout that "helpfully" converts either way rewrites thousands of
# lines and buries the real diff. I normalised three files by accident today
# reading and rewriting them with Python's text mode; this makes that a
# no-op at the git layer regardless.
* -text
